Experimental evidence – Published
PMID: 39638757 – Functional studies demonstrate that the splice variant causes aberrant splicing with significantly reduced LRRC45 mRNA and protein expression in patient-derived fibroblasts. Additionally, patient cells exhibited reduced primary cilia frequency and shortened cilia length, supporting a ciliogenesis defect consistent with disease mechanism.
Functional alteration (patient cells) = 1.0;
